## Highlights
● Co-NCNTNP catalyst was firstly used to modify activated carbon air-cathode MFC. ● The MPD of the optimized MFC is $2252\mathrm{mW}\mathrm{m}^{-2}$ , $154\%$ higher than that of control. ● The combination of transition metal and nitrogen chemical state in carbon nanotube was beneficial to advanced ORR activity.   
Electrochemical measurements demonstrated Co-NCNTNP exhibited a desired four-electron pathway for oxygen reduction.
